Usage: mailpit-agent <command> [arguments]

Commands:
  status                              Show service and Mailpit runtime status.
  list [limit]                        List recent message summaries as JSON.
  latest-id                           Print the newest message ID.
  latest                              Show the newest message summary as JSON.
  show <message-id|latest>            Show a complete message as JSON.
  text <message-id|latest>            Print the plain-text message body.
  html <message-id|latest>            Print the HTML message body.
  wait-new <previous-id|none> [seconds] [subject]
                                      Wait for a newer message and show it as JSON.
  help                                Show this help.

Examples:
  before="$(mailpit-agent latest-id || true)"
  # Trigger the email under test here.
  mailpit-agent wait-new "${before:-none}" 30 "renewal"

